{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42921","headline":"送人游邵州 · 狄焕","name":"送人游邵州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春江正渺渺，送别两依依。\n烟里棹将远，渡头人未归。\n渔家侵叠浪，岛树挂残晖。\n况入湖湘路，那堪花乱飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"狄焕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}